Fonts: local Windows KaiTi / SimSun or platform serif fallback; no font file is redistributed.
Sound: original composition using the library's physically modelled guqin, plus original synthesized water and wind. No samples, narration or third-party music.

Second revision: original four-bus synthesis in studio/audio/score-v2.py. NumPy/SciPy synthesis and existing upstream guqin model; no original film audio samples. The ink flute is synthesized, not a recorded xiao.

Third revision: original continuous actor/paper/card choreography and score-v3.py. Bird, paper and pointer sounds are procedural synthesis; no field recordings or upstream film audio.

Fourth revision: original articulated bird rig, large-scale editorial typography and 108-object routing. New procedural cues in score-v4.py; no upstream footage, music or third-party recordings added.

Fifth revision: original two-bird response choreography, per-character typography and camera projection route. All new sound cues are procedural in score-v5.py; no upstream film samples or new external assets.

Round 6: original ensemble staging, hand-authored display stroke paths, or solid geometry and software texture projection, according to this style. No upstream footage or audio sampled.
